senses.gloss:
(1) PIPER LONGUM LINN. (Bpn; Dgv; Dutt; DWH 3, p. 176; MW;
PW; V 6, p. 120; Vśs);
(2) a) = जीरक (Bpn; Vśs);
b) cumin seed (MW; PW);
(3) = वनजीरक (see जीरक) (Avk; KB 2, p. 1325-1327).

(1) SOLANUM XANTHOCARPUM SCHRAD. ET WENDL. (Avk; Bpn, p.
289-292; Chopra; Dutt; DWH 2, p. 557-559; Dy, p. 636-637; Gul;
HK; Kav; KB 3, p. 1759-1762; Nadk. 1, nr. 2338; PA 1, 4, p. 93;
Sanyal; Vśs) = S. JACQUINI WILLD. (Ainslie 2, p. 90-91; Avk; Dutt;
HK; Kav; MW; Nadk. 1, nr. 2330; PA 1, 4, p. 93; PW; Roxb., p.
191; Sanyal; Vśs; Wise) = S. DIFFUSUM ROXB. (Nadk. 1, nr. 2330) =
S. VIRGINIANUM JACQ. (Nadk. 1, nr. 2330);
(2) S. INDICUM LINN. (KB 3, p. 1755-1757);
(3) S. FEROX LINN. (DWH 2, p. 560: incorrectly used; KB 3, p.
1754-1755 and V 3, p. 70: श्वेतकण्टकारिका);
(4) S. TRILOBATUM LINN. (DWH 2, p. 559-560: used as a substitute);
(5) S. TORVUM Sw. (DWH 2, p. 560: incorrectly used);
(6) S. VERBASCIFOLIUM LINN. (DWH 2, p. 560: incorrectly used).

(1) HYGROPHILA SPINOSA T. ANDERS. (Kav; KB 3, p. 1864-1865;
Vśs) = ASTERACANTHA LONGIFOLIA NEES (KB 3, p. 1864-1865; MW;
PW) = RUELLIA LONGIFOLIA ROXB. (Kav; Vśs);
(2) SACCHARUM SPONTANEUM LINN. (HB; Kav; MW; PW; Vśs);
(3) a particular type or particular types of sugar-cane (Gul: big
sugar-cane; Kav, p. 293: a variety of sugar-cane that yields less juice
and is much harder; Vśs: white sugar-cane, dark sugar-cane).
